Subject: [PATCH 10/14] urltest: urls (every URL tested, the slowest counts,
 one failing fails the server) and min_dwell

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 option/group.go                |  5 ++++
 protocol/group/urltest.go      | 48 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 protocol/group/urltest_test.go | 25 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 71 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/option/group.go b/option/group.go
index 367be6799..7537613e8 100644
--- a/option/group.go
+++ b/option/group.go
@@ -27,6 +27,11 @@ type URLTestOutboundOptions struct {
 	// H: a server is taken only after this many tests in a row answered, by their average; until one has,
 	// everything goes through WarmUpDetour (not through the first server listed)
 	StableSamples int `json:"stable_samples,omitempty"`
+	// H: a server in use is kept at least this long after the last switch while it still answers every test
+	MinDwell badoption.Duration `json:"min_dwell,omitempty"`
+	// H: with several urls a server is tested against all of them, the slowest answer is its delay and one that
